{"1938540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eternal Spectre", "steam_appid": 1938540, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/fb92b885f053d158d1818a9ba9c3b8cb.avif?t=1787717302\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras_big/fb92b885f053d158d1818a9ba9c3b8cb.webp?t=1787717302 width=1560 height=520 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eternal Spectre is a non-linear action RPG where your choices shape missions, characters, and outcomes. Dialogue and actions both matter, and consequences can show up immediately or much later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/9b89c2fb746e805ef12683acf25c5b02.poster.avif?t=1787717302\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/9b89c2fb746e805ef12683acf25c5b02.webm?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/9b89c2fb746e805ef12683acf25c5b02.mp4?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/1ac5a18d764f56e5e64d080aa1ba8390.avif?t=1787717302\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras_big/1ac5a18d764f56e5e64d080aa1ba8390.webp?t=1787717302 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Jared Miles, bound to a mysterious entity, navigating a world damaged by the Time Fracture. The story is built to branch repeatedly, with player decisions changing how events unfold, who survives, who allies with you, and what paths remain available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/06800d4a2f418045e8d2053a1e6f1ce7.poster.avif?t=1787717302\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/06800d4a2f418045e8d2053a1e6f1ce7.webm?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/06800d4a2f418045e8d2053a1e6f1ce7.mp4?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/a7cca6405045dc1911b901f971ee74ba.poster.avif?t=1787717302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/a7cca6405045dc1911b901f971ee74ba.webm?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/a7cca6405045dc1911b901f971ee74ba.mp4?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/82f1e2e11a0bb7e7487e530ae55f42c7.avif?t=1787717302\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras_big/82f1e2e11a0bb7e7487e530ae55f42c7.webp?t=1787717302 width=1560 height=520 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-based combat focused on shooting, positioning, and timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Gau as a standalone weapon or enhance it using Fragments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shield gameplay that supports both damage absorption and well-timed parries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Booster-based dash for dodging, repositioning, and combat mobility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Skills acquired through exploration and mission rewards to expand your combat options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip and combine Fragments to shape your build, stats, and playstyle direction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/dca2178aefe9a7619a1c16c7ae44fd08.poster.avif?t=1787717302\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/dca2178aefe9a7619a1c16c7ae44fd08.webm?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/dca2178aefe9a7619a1c16c7ae44fd08.mp4?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/ae5c16be1197ed066ea3d960337d935d.poster.avif?t=1787717302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/ae5c16be1197ed066ea3d960337d935d.webm?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/ae5c16be1197ed066ea3d960337d935d.mp4?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/51e5fd8662a703b40c9e4c527c01f570.avif?t=1787717302\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras_big/51e5fd8662a703b40c9e4c527c01f570.webp?t=1787717302 width=1560 height=543 /></span><br>Customize the character’s appearance to reflect your identity in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/09c4b59f51ba731864eaac7950664acb.poster.avif?t=1787717302\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/09c4b59f51ba731864eaac7950664acb.webm?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/09c4b59f51ba731864eaac7950664acb.mp4?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun and Gear Progression</strong> <br>Gun and equipped gear level up over time. Progression is tied to usage and upgrades rather than weapon swapping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Builds</strong><br>There are no fixed classes. Builds are defined by Equipment upgrades, character stats, equipped gear levels, and the <strong>Fragments system</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stats and Fragments System</strong><br>Stats directly influence combat effectiveness and survivability. Fragments provide additional modifiers and playstyle-defining effects that further shape the player’s build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/9ac04a2bb7882090bd23e43b6364ed90.poster.avif?t=1787717302\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/9ac04a2bb7882090bd23e43b6364ed90.webm?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/9ac04a2bb7882090bd23e43b6364ed90.mp4?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill System</strong><br>Skills are not unlocked automatically. Players discover and obtain skills through exploration, mission rewards, and progression choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Linear Narrative</strong><br>The story branches based on dialogue choices and player actions. Decisions affect characters, future missions, and narrative outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/a833e8ac6185902c98dad57dc549d762.poster.avif?t=1787717302\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/a833e8ac6185902c98dad57dc549d762.webm?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/a833e8ac6185902c98dad57dc549d762.mp4?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive NPCs</strong><br>NPCs respond to the player’s behaviour, decisions, and reputation. Information spreads, and the world remembers what you do.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/c077aaa1f810867e3dcd7beacc88457b.poster.avif?t=1787717302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/c077aaa1f810867e3dcd7beacc88457b.webm?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/c077aaa1f810867e3dcd7beacc88457b.mp4?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/fb92b885f053d158d1818a9ba9c3b8cb.avif?t=1787717302\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras_big/fb92b885f053d158d1818a9ba9c3b8cb.webp?t=1787717302 width=1560 height=520 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eternal Spectre is a non-linear action RPG where your choices shape missions, characters, and outcomes. Dialogue and actions both matter, and consequences can show up immediately or much later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/9b89c2fb746e805ef12683acf25c5b02.poster.avif?t=1787717302\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/9b89c2fb746e805ef12683acf25c5b02.webm?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/9b89c2fb746e805ef12683acf25c5b02.mp4?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_