rades, character stats, equipped gear levels, and the <strong>Fragments system</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stats and Fragments System</strong><br>Stats directly influence combat effectiveness and survivability. Fragments provide additional modifiers and playstyle-defining effects that further shape the player’s build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/9ac04a2bb7882090bd23e43b6364ed90.poster.avif?t=1787717302\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/9ac04a2bb7882090bd23e43b6364ed90.webm?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/9ac04a2bb7882090bd23e43b6364ed90.mp4?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill System</strong><br>Skills are not unlocked automatically. Players discover and obtain skills through exploration, mission rewards, and progression choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Linear Narrative</strong><br>The story branches based on dialogue choices and player actions. Decisions affect characters, future missions, and narrative outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/a833e8ac6185902c98dad57dc549d762.poster.avif?t=1787717302\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/a833e8ac6185902c98dad57dc549d762.webm?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/a833e8ac6185902c98dad57dc549d762.mp4?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive NPCs</strong><br>NPCs respond to the player’s behaviour, decisions, and reputation. Information spreads, and the world remembers what you do.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/c077aaa1f810867e3dcd7beacc88457b.poster.avif?t=1787717302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/c077aaa1f810867e3dcd7beacc88457b.webm?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/extras/c077aaa1f810867e3dcd7beacc88457b.mp4?t=1787717302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>", "short_description": "In a world where Time is Fractured. Jared Miles navigates a broken reality where every choice reshapes the world, uncovering the truth behind the fracture and deciding what the world ultimately becomes.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/c64656050be47996ecb99a4a15d6dbb61508baaf/header.jpg?t=1787717302", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/bd2974d3c586673ef78a356b726a886b0d87cfb2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787717302", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938540/bd2974d3c586673ef78a356b726a886b0d87cfb2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787717302", "website": "http://eternalspectre.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Process